event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":82,"item_id":"rs_06d6e9a41dc499f2016aca9de49dc087d1bf4a4234c241ce6b","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering test robustness**\n\nI'm thinking about how I need to allocate enough time to write and run thorough tests. It's important to ensure that my tests are robust, so they can effectively handle unexpected situations. Balancing my time budget is crucial here because I want to avoid rushing through this process. I wonder if I have a good enough strategy in place to make sure everything checks out, while still managing my schedule efficiently!"}

